5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to be with you all. To ensure the project we choose has the human support it needs, I will look into staffing rolls for technical posts and minutes on secondments and crew strength.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I'm happy to be here too. To understand how the funding is actually being utilized these days, I'll look into the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers and the national computing agreement and facility day rates.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to see how the shared services are doing! I'll check the incident logs on shared instrumentation and the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I believe it is prudent to identify where the actual bottlenecks lie. I shall examine the portfolio review of schedule overruns and the station records from partner field sites.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the closeout files of finished awards and the national repository deposit turnaround to see what has actually been delivered in the past.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It seems we have a comprehensive plan. By covering the human, financial, logistical, and historical aspects, we shall have a very clear picture of the landscape before we meet the candidates.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I agree, Servas. It feels like we are all looking at different but equally important pieces of the puzzle. I look forward to hearing what everyone discovers.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I'm excited too! I hope the things I find will help us pick the best project. Let's see what happens!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. A diverse set of inquiries should prevent us from falling into the trap of collective blind spots. I suspect the data will be quite illuminating.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I agree. A broad data set is the only way to ensure our decision is based on evidence rather than intuition. I will wait for the results.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Since we have all committed to our chosen records, I believe we have exhausted the need for further planning in this turn. I am content to proceed to the investigation.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Servas. We have a balanced approach, and I'm eager to see how these different perspectives come together. I'm ready to move forward.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Kenji,,Me too! I'm all set and ready to go. Let's find out what's going on with the facilities!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I concur. There is little utility in further deliberation until the facts are before us. I am ready to proceed.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I concur. There is nothing more to be gained from discussion until the data is retrieved. I am ready.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,Then let us move forward in harmony. I wish you all a productive search for the truths hidden within these records. I shall see you in the next round.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
